<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Styland Holdings suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Styland Holdings suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Styland Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request, pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The company shares closed HK$0.075 higher at HK$0.455 on Thursday on volume of 264.90 million shares.</p>
<p>Styland holds garment and consumer electronics firms.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
